	Just another suggestion for NH 3.1. How about making the boulders
a little more useful. Characters strong enough to move boulders might be
able to crush small to medium monsters against walls and closed doors.
Instead of saying "You hear a monster behind the boulder. Perhaps that is
why you cannot move it." It could say: "You crush the sewer rat against the
wall!" Of course this would leave a corpse. Bigger monsters would be
resistant. Also going along with moving mosters who are behind bolders, you
could push them into traps; and closets and close the door, locking them in.
Polymorphing into a giant or similar creature allows you to throw boulders,
so why not be able to crush monsters with them?
